          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in offensive strikes targeting shipping, ports, and regional infrastructure in the Gulf rapidly disrupts logistics and energy supplies (and damages intermediate suppliers), causing semiconductor fabs and their supply chains to miss inputs or shipments and reducing effective production throughput." />
