          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A higher tempo of offensive strikes in the theater increases the number of direct attacks on commercial vessels, mines laid, and near-miss incidents as combatants and proxies target or mistake shipping, raising maritime security incidents." />
