          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Higher diplomatic tensions provoke capital flight and exchange‑rate stress in exposed or regional currencies, prompting official authorities to increase FX intervention (selling FX reserves or buying domestic currency) to defend rates." />
