          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sharp increases in bond-market volatility drive broad investor risk aversion and repricing, directly raising market participants' perception of geopolitical and supply-disruption risk that is applied to maritime energy exposure." />
